 ${python3:Depends},
 python3-mcprack-client,
Description: keep VS Code Copilot MCP config in sync with mcprack
 Fetches the user's selected MCP servers from a mcprack instance and merges
 them into VS Code's User/mcp.json (servers key). Includes an optional
 systemd user timer.
